{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearbyNPCsJson = get_nearby_actors_not_in_ostim(npc.UUID) %}
{% set ostimPotentialParticipantsString = nearbyNPCsJson.actorsNameString %}
{{speakingNpc.name}} initiates non-sexual physical caring scene. Use when NPC explicitly INITIATES physical caring, NOT for affectionate talk or commentary during/after other scenes, NOT for intercourse (use StartNewSex).
Available Partners: {{ostimPotentialParticipantsString}}.
Available intents: romantic = affectionate/caring with emotional warmth or romance; platonic = friendly/comforting without romantic or sensual interest (friends, family); lustful = physically charged/sensual closeness driven by physical attraction without emotional strings; transactional = physical affection given or received in exchange for coin, favors, leverage, or service.
Available activities for romantic, lustful, transactional: hugging|kissing
Available activities for platonic: hugging
